  "description": "The meme relies on antisemitic tropes by portraying Hitler as a 'camper'—a coward who avoids direct involvement in the atrocities he ordered. This is a form of antisemitic stereotype that attempts to minimize his responsibility by suggesting he is not a direct perpetrator, thereby trivializing the Holocaust and the suffering of its victims.",
